      "questionHtml": "If in a certain code language, LAYOFF is written as 11-0-24-14-5-5. How will the word REFUSE be written in that code language?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "17-4-5-20-18-4",
          "html": "17-4-5-20-18-4&nbsp;"
        },
        {
