        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "18-6-5-19-18-18",
          "html": "18-6-5-19-18-18&nbsp;"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>The pattern followed here is,</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/quesImage859.png\" /></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/04/10%20Apr-3.PNG\" style=\"width: 220px; height: 198px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>Similarly, we have:</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/04/10%20Apr-2.PNG\" style=\"width: 220px; height: 203px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>Hence,&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">17-4-5-20-18-4&nbsp;</span>is the correct answer.</p>\n",
