    {
      "id": "0532bf611b58-q4",
      "number": 4,
      "question": "In a certain code language, &lsquo;BRAVE&rsquo; is coded as 28591 and &lsquo;BREAD&rsquo; is coded as 19752. What will be the code for &lsquo;D&rsquo; in the given code language?",
      "questionHtml": "In a certain code language, &lsquo;BRAVE&rsquo; is coded as 28591 and &lsquo;BREAD&rsquo; is coded as 19752. What will be the code for &lsquo;D&rsquo; in the given code language?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "2",
          "html": "2"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "7",
          "html": "7"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "5",
          "html": "5"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "8",
          "html": "8"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>According to the given information:</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/08/F2_Madhuri_State%20Govt._29.08.2022_D2.png\" style=\"width: 402px; height: 69px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><strong>B, R, A, and E&nbsp;</strong>are the common alphabets in the letters.</p>\n\n<p>Thus their codes are repeated.</p>\n\n<p>The possible codes are;</p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\" width: 300px;\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Letters</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Code</strong></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">B</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">2/1/5/9</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">R</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">2/1/5/9</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">A</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">2/1/5/9</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">E</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">2/1/5/9</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">D</span></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">7</span></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">V</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">8</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p><br />\nAs we can see there are different possibilities of codes for B, R, E, and A.</p>\n\n<p>Only <strong>7</strong> is constant code for D;&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">So, </span><strong><span style=\"\">&#39;7&#39;</span></strong><span style=\"\"> will be the code for</span><strong><span style=\"\"> D.</span></strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Hence, the correct answer is <strong>&quot;7&quot;.</strong></span></p>\n",
      "images": [
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/08/F2_Madhuri_State%20Govt._29.08.2022_D2.png"
      ],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0532bf611b58-q5",
      "number": 5,
      "question": "In a certain code language, &lsquo;EARNS&rsquo; is coded as &lsquo;51181419&rsquo; then how will &lsquo;NACHO&rsquo; be coded in that language?",
      "questionHtml": "In a certain code language, &lsquo;EARNS&rsquo; is coded as &lsquo;51181419&rsquo; then how will &lsquo;NACHO&rsquo; be coded in that language?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "1113515",
          "html": "1113515"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "1213816",
          "html": "1213816"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "1312817",
          "html": "1312817"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "1413815",
          "html": "1413815"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/quesImage264.png\" /></p>\n\n<p>The logic is;</p>\n\n<p>E = 5</p>\n\n<p>A = 1</p>\n\n<p>R = 18</p>\n\n<p>N = 14</p>\n\n<p>S = 19</p>\n\n<p>EARNS = 51181419</p>\n\n<p>Similarly,</p>\n\n<p>N = 14</p>\n\n<p>A = 1</p>\n\n<p>C = 3</p>\n\n<p>H = 8</p>\n\n<p>O = 15</p>\n\n<p>NACHO = 1413815</p>\n\n<p>Hence, NACHO is coded as <strong>1413815</strong>.</p>\n",
      "images": [
        "//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/quesImage264.png"
      ],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0532bf611b58-q6",
