      "question": "In a code language, if GREAT is written as 718222620 and MONK is written as 13121411, then how will VIGOROUS be written in the same language?",
      "questionHtml": "In a code language, if GREAT is written as 718222620 and MONK is written as 13121411, then how will VIGOROUS be written in the same language?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "22187121812619",
          "html": "22187121812619"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "21177121811619",
          "html": "21177121811619"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "22187131813620",
          "html": "22187131813620"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "21187111711620",
          "html": "21187111711620"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage668795189362dece75a841e2.png\" style=\"height: 92px; width: 330px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>The logic followed here is;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Logic: Vowel&nbsp;&rarr; </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-weight: 700;\">Positional Values of Reverse Positional alphabets.</span></p>\n\n<p><strong>Consonant&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">&rarr; Positional value of the alphabets.</span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;For&nbsp;GREAT is written as 718222620;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/07/F1_SSC_%20Priya_5_7_24_D2.png\" style=\"width: 133px; height: 91px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>For,&nbsp;MONK is written as 13121411;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/07/F1_SSC_%20Priya_5_7_24_D3.png\" style=\"width: 120px; height: 84px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>Similarly, for&nbsp;VIGOROUS;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/07/F1_SSC_%20Priya_5_7_24_D4.png\" style=\"width: 220px; height: 84px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>So,&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">VIGOROUS is written as 22187121812619.</span></p>\n\n<p>Hence, the correct answer is <strong>Option (1).&nbsp;</strong></p>\n",
      "images": [
        "//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/qImage668795189362dece75a841e2.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/07/F1_SSC_%20Priya_5_7_24_D2.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/07/F1_SSC_%20Priya_5_7_24_D3.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/07/F1_SSC_%20Priya_5_7_24_D4.png"
      ],
