      "solution": "<p>As PALE is coded as 7865 and EARTH as 58432</p>\n\n<p>Drawing the code chart using the above information we get,</p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width:200px;\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Letter</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Code</strong></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">P</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">7</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">A</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">8</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">L</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">6</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">E</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">5</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width:200px;\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Letter</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Code</strong></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">E</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">5</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">A</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">8</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">R</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">4</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">T</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">3</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">H</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">2</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Assigning the corresponding number to the given letter we get,</p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width:200px;\">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Letter</strong></td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Code</strong></td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">A</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">8</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">L</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">6</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">E</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">5</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">R</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">4</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">T</td>\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">3</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is <strong>Option 3.</strong></p>\n",
