      "id": "0532bf611b58-q9",
      "number": 9,
      "question": "In a code language, if SPEED is written as 811222223, then how will LINEAR be written in the same language?",
      "questionHtml": "In a code language, if SPEED is written as 811222223, then how will LINEAR be written in the same language?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "15914222169",
          "html": "15914222169"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "12181322268",
          "html": "12181322268"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "15181322239",
          "html": "15181322239"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "15181322269",
          "html": "15181322269"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>The pattern followed here is:</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/quesImage264.png\" /></p>\n\n<p>According to the alphabetical positions of the letters,</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/03/F1_Sweta%20Singh_19.3.21_Pallavi_D28.png\" /></p>\n\n<p>Letters are coded by the place value of their reverse letters.</p>\n\n<p>Similarly,</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/03/F1_Sweta%20Singh_19.3.21_Pallavi_D29.png\" style=\"width: 237px; height: 144px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>Hence, &lsquo;<strong>15181322269</strong>&rsquo; is the correct answer.</p>\n",
